    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "SAN FRANCISCO /\nOAKLAND\nUNITED\nEFFECTIVE JULY 1, 1965\n1901817901e 07\nEles 07\nFalls wedooroas\nPoe\nдохо\nTall\n• Перив\"\nMAKE THIS YEAR'S\nVACATION\nA FAMILY AFFAIR\nWITH UNITED'S NEW LOW\nFAMILY PLAN FARES\n(see map page)",
      "SAN FRANCISCO /\nOAKLAND\nUNITED\nEFFECTIVE JULY 1, 1965\nMAKE THIS YEAR'S\nVACATION\nA FAMILY AFFAIR\nWITH UNITED'S NEW LOW\nFAMILY PLAN FARES\n(see map page)",
      "VANCOUVER, B.C\nSEATTLE-TACOMA\nSPOKANE\nPORTLANI\nSALEN\nEUGENE\nPENDLETON\nBOISE\nMEDFORD\nELKO\nSAN FRANCISCO-\nOAKLAND,\nSACRAMENTO\nSTOCKTON\nELY\nMONTEREY\nSALINAS\nMERCES-\nFRESNO\nVISALIA\nBAKERSFIELD\nLAS VEGAS\nSANTA BARBAR\nHONOLULU\nOS ANGELES-\nSAN DIEGO\nSALT LAKE CITY\nGRAND JUNCTION\nDENVER\nSEE THE\nUSA\n- UNITED/BRANIFF INTERCHANGE SERVICE\nTRANSCONTINENTAL NONSTOP JET SERVICE\nSEATTLE /TACOMA\nSAN FRANCISCO\nNEW YORK\n/ PHILADELPHIA\nWASHINGT\nLOS ANGELES\n_HONOLULU\nMINNEAPOLIS-ST. PAUL\n• BOSTON\nSAGINAW-BAY SITY MIDLAND\nMUSKEGON FLINT\nROCHESTER\nMILWAUKEE\nHARTFORD-SPRINGFIELD\nELMIRA-CORNINE\nPROVIDENCE\nGRAND RAPIDS\nDETROIT\nNEW YORK\nCEDAR RE\nDES MOINES\nCHICAGO\nYOUNGSTOWN-WAR\nN SHARON\nSOUTH BEND AKRON-CANT\nORT WAYNE PITTSBUR\nPRISBURG-YON\nKLENTOWN-BETHLEHEM-EASTON\nPHILADELPHIA\nMOLINE-ROCK ISLAND-DAVENPORT\nDAYTON\nLINCOLN\nCOLUMBUS\nCHARLESTON, W. V\nBALTIMORE\nWASHINGTON\nNEWPORT NEWS-HAMPTON\nWILLIAMSBURG\nRICHMOND\nNORFOLK-PORTSMOUTH\nBRISTOL-KINGSPORT-JOHNSON CL\nKANSAS eIT\nGREENSBORO HIGH POIN\nWINSTON-SALEN\nRALEIGH-DURHAM\nMEMPHIS\nKNOXVIL\nASHEVILLE\nCHATTANOOG\nHUNTSVILLE\nCHARLOTTE\nATLANTA\nBIRMINGHA\nDALLAS\nJACKSONVILLE\nMOBILE\nNEW ORLEAN\nHOUSTON\nTANTA\nST. PETERSBURG\nCLEARWATER\nWEST PALM BEACH\nMIAMI-\nFORT LAUDERDALE\nUnited's new Family Plan saves you\n⅓ for your wife, ⅓ for your children\nHere's how it works weekdays - From noon Mon-\nday through noon Friday, head of family pays full jet\nCoach fare. Wife pays ⅔ the regular fare, children two\nthrough 21, ⅓ the regular fare.\nNew weekend plan - From 12:01 a.m. Saturday\nthrough noon Sunday, head of family pays full jet Coach\nfare. Wife pays ¾ the regular fare, children two through\n11, 2 the regular fare, and children 12 through 21, ¾\nthe regular fare.\nUse your Bank Americard, Diners Club, Carte Blanche,\nAmerican Express or United's Fly Now Pay Later plan to\ncharge your trip.\nEffective now to all United cities except Honolulu"
    ],
